# Copy to .env.local and fill in to enable WalletConnect / mobile wallets.
#
# Get an id from https://cloud.walletconnect.com. If this is left unset the app
# runs with injected wallets only (MetaMask, Rabby, Brave, …) and makes no
# requests to WalletConnect. Do not put a placeholder value here ,a fake id
# causes 403/400 responses from api.web3modal.org on every page load.
VITE_WALLETCONNECT_PROJECT_ID=
